\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">。课程旨在为博望餐饮客户提供专业的法务指导，帮助其在招商加盟过程中规避风险，保障企业合法权益，吸引了60余位餐饮人到场，座无虚席，气氛热烈。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><br style=\"visibility: visible;\"></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">本次课程为博望团队资深律师</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">刘舒律师</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">与博望团队首席顾问</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">马俊龙律师</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">带来精彩分享。主持人为博望团队合伙人</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">党俏律师</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"display: flex; width: 100%; flex-flow: column; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"z-index: 1; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"justify-content: center; display: flex; flex-flow: row; margin: 20px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; width: 92%; vertical-align: top; align-self: flex-start; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: flex; flex-flow: row; text-align: left; justify-content: flex-start; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; width: auto; flex: 100 100 0%; align-self: flex-start; height: auto; margin: 0px 10px 0px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"justify-content: flex-start; display: flex; f